{"4207100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Know a Spot", "steam_appid": 4207100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car, set up beautiful campsites, explore cozy locations, and enjoy time with your dog. Build the perfect spot to simply breathe and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Know a Spot is a cozy building game focused on atmosphere, creative freedom, vehicle customization, and peaceful exploration. You travel through forests, lakes, mountains, and seasonal environments, each with a calm mood, soft lighting, and detailed nature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your car</strong><br>You can personalize multiple cars with different models, colors, wheels, accessories, and small visual upgrades. Every car can feel unique. After arriving at a location, you unpack your gear and place objects freely around the campsite. Tents, lanterns, chairs, stoves, tables, decor items, and small props help you create warm and inviting scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Add dog to your campsite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal dog companion walks around the camp, reacts to the environment, sits nearby, and brings life to every setup. Your dog makes each spot feel personal and cozy. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no timers, no pressure, and no objectives. I Know a Spot is a relaxing sandbox focused on creative building and peaceful moments in nature. You can arrange campsites, customize vehicles, explore new locations, and return to your favorite spots whenever you want.<br><br>If you enjoy cozy building games, calm exploration, nature scenery, and simple creative play, this game is for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your car, set up beautiful campsites, explore cozy locations, and enjoy time with your dog. Build the perfect spot to simply breathe and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Know a Spot is a cozy building game focused on atmosphere, creative freedom, vehicle customization, and peaceful exploration. You travel through forests, lakes, mountains, and seasonal environments, each with a calm mood, soft lighting, and detailed nature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/38b9b7bfd7d438457f4cbe121269bcb3.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your car</strong><br>You can personalize multiple cars with different models, colors, wheels, accessories, and small visual upgrades. Every car can feel unique. After arriving at a location, you unpack your gear and place objects freely around the campsite. Tents, lanterns, chairs, stoves, tables, decor items, and small props help you create warm and inviting scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/a462560ad80612c616028bdfe24119e6.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Add dog to your campsite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal dog companion walks around the camp, reacts to the environment, sits nearby, and brings life to every setup. Your dog makes each spot feel personal and cozy. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.poster.avif?t=1787633636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.webm?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/extras/69e83c0b0f908980d9004c052f98a6dd.mp4?t=1787633636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no timers, no pressure, and no objectives. I Know a Spot is a relaxing sandbox focused on creative building and peaceful moments in nature. You can arrange campsites, customize vehicles, explore new locations, and return to your favorite spots whenever you want.<br><br>If you enjoy cozy building games, calm exploration, nature scenery, and simple creative play, this game is for you.</p>", "short_description": "Customize your car, set up beautiful campsites, explore cozy locations, and enjoy time with your dog. Build the perfect spot to simply breathe and relax.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/6cfaad727815396ae5ac3694bfc9d536e6afe100/header.jpg?t=1787633636", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/e1787b7b118b1476eca8203b3c40fa3b7e1994a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787633636", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207100/e1787b7b118b1476eca8203b3c40fa3b7e1994a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787633636", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<